Robotics Engineering Pathway — index
====================================

This is the restructured 12-month syllabus. Start at
00-introduction/00-introduction.md.
The file named Syllabus is the original 6-month article, kept for reference.

Modules live in folders named by number and title. Open the markdown file
inside the folder for that module.

Time model
----------
- Standard: 12 months at 12–15 hours/week, from zero electronics.
- Fast: 6 months at 15–20 hours/week if you already write Python and live
  in a Linux terminal. Skip only items tagged Fast-path skip.
- Hours in the modules include failed prints and bring-up, not watch time.

