Tags
----
Mandatory        Required for the milestone.
Optional         Depth. Skip if the calendar says so.
Fast-path skip   Standard learners still do these.

Success
-------
Build at least six working projects. Polish three for applications
(video, metrics, "What broke and how I fixed it"). Depth in one track,
literacy in the rest. This is entry, not senior.
